{"id":"torrey:feast-of-the-new-moon-the","source":"torrey","name":"Feast Of The New Moon, The","slug":"feast-of-the-new-moon-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Held first day of the month — Nu 10:10.","refs":[["Num",10,10,10,10]]},{"text":"Celebrated with blowing of trumpets — Nu 10:10; Ps 81:3,4.","refs":[["Num",10,10,10,10],["Ps",81,3,81,3],["Ps",81,4,81,4]]},{"text":"Sacrifices at — Nu 28:11-15.","refs":[["Num",28,11,28,15]]},{"text":"Inquiring of God’s messengers. — 2Ki 4:23.","refs":[["2Kgs",4,23,4,23]]},{"text":"Worship in God’s house. — Isa 66:23; Eze 46:1.","refs":[["Isa",66,23,66,23],["Ezek",46,1,46,1]]},{"text":"Entertainments. — 1Sa 20:5,18.","refs":[["1Sam",20,5,20,5],["1Sam",20,18,20,18]]},{"text":"Observed with great solemnity — 1Ch 23:31; 2Ch 2:4; 8:13; 31:3.","refs":[["1Chr",23,31,23,31],["2Chr",2,4,2,4],["2Chr",8,13,8,13],["2Chr",31,3,31,3]]},{"text":"Restored after captivity — Ezr 3:5; Ne 10:33.","refs":[["Ezra",3,5,3,5],["Neh",10,33,10,33]]},{"text":"Mere outward observance of, hateful to God — Isa 1:13,14.","refs":[["Isa",1,13,1,13],["Isa",1,14,1,14]]},{"text":"Disliked by the ungodly — Am 8:5.","refs":[["Amos",8,5,8,5]]},{"text":"The Jews deprived of, for sin — Ho 2:11.","refs":[["Hos",2,11,2,11]]},{"text":"Observance of, by Christians, condemned — Col 2:16; Ga 4:10.","refs":[["Col",2,16,2,16],["Gal",4,10,4,10]]}],"refCount":22}
